WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Proportion compares dimensions such as wheelbase, track, cabin height and overhang. State the view and measurement convention.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
On a side drawing, compare front and rear overhang to wheelbase as ratios instead of relying on a cropped photograph.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Measured-overlay comparison

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A view can support interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance by itself.

